### Payment Gateway API Demo
### VS Code: Install "REST Client" extension by Huachao Mao

# @name cleanup
# Cleanup before demo

###
# @name Step1_HealthCheck
GET http://localhost:8090/actuator/health

###
# @name Step2_SuccessPayment
POST http://localhost:8090/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Merchant-Id: merchant-123
Idempotency-Key: demo-success-1

{
  "card_number": "4242424242424241",
  "expiry_month": 12,
  "expiry_year": 2027,
  "currency": "USD",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

###
# @name Step3_CacheHit
# Same key - returns cached result
POST http://localhost:8090/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Merchant-Id: merchant-123
Idempotency-Key: demo-success-1

{
  "card_number": "4242424242424241",
  "expiry_month": 12,
  "expiry_year": 2027,
  "currency": "USD",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

###
# @name Step4_ValidationError
POST http://localhost:8090/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Merchant-Id: merchant-123
Idempotency-Key: demo-validation-1

{
  "card_number": "abc",
  "expiry_month": 12,
  "expiry_year": 2027,
  "currency": "USD",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
